1
00:00:20,462 --> 00:00:22,642
拜托 为什么它们都不跟着我
Come on. Why aren't they transferring to me?

2
00:00:22,642 --> 00:00:24,112
我跟你一模一样啊
I look just like you.

3
00:00:24,182 --> 00:00:26,112
可能我的气味不对
Maybe I don't have the scent right.

4
00:00:29,072 --> 00:00:31,891
几周前 我发现了一窝鸭蛋
A few weeks ago, I found a nest of duck eggs.

5
00:00:31,901 --> 00:00:34,471
我 我悉心照料
I, uh... I lovingly nursed them,

6
00:00:34,471 --> 00:00:38,191
结果 某些人撞狗屎运
and then, uh, by some...sick fluke,

7
00:00:38,191 --> 00:00:40,221
鸭子出生时 只有克莱尔在场
Claire was the only one there when the ducks were born,

8
00:00:40,221 --> 00:00:43,581
所以它们把她印刻于心了
so they imprinted on her.

9
00:00:43,581 --> 00:00:44,911
我不是故意的啊
Oh, I didn't do it on purpose.

10
00:00:44,911 --> 00:00:46,610
那就让它们回到我身边啊
Then make them come back to me.

11
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:50,300
谁这个点儿打电话啊
Who's calling at this hour?

12
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:52,100
你好
Hello?

13
00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:53,920
怎么了
Yes?

14
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:55,580
卢克被捕了
Luke's been arrested!

15
00:01:10,659 --> 00:01:12,818
早上好 莱纳德
Well, good morning, Leonard.

16
00:01:12,918 --> 00:01:13,598
莱纳
Leonar--

17
00:01:13,598 --> 00:01:15,428
我知道我的乖儿子卢克
I know it's not my well-behaved son, Luke,

18
00:01:15,428 --> 00:01:17,238
才不会没拿驾照就偷开我们的车出去
who'd never take our car out without a license

19
00:01:17,238 --> 00:01:18,478
然后被捕
and get arrested.

20
00:01:18,478 --> 00:01:20,438
我偷开车出去是有正当理由的
I took the car for a good reason.

21
00:01:20,448 --> 00:01:22,918
萨拉·费舍尔的猫死了 她悲痛至极
Sarah Fisher's cat died, and she was devastated,

22
00:01:22,918 --> 00:01:25,268
所以我猜她可能会想要跟我亲热
so I thought she might make out with me.

23
00:01:25,527 --> 00:01:28,347
结果在离她家两个街区的地方被抓了
I got caught two blocks away from her house.

24
00:01:28,357 --> 00:01:31,507
所有人泡妞的运气都超好 除了我
Everyone is having great luck with girls except for me.

25
00:01:31,617 --> 00:01:33,737
我真的是指所有人
And I mean everyone.

26
00:01:33,737 --> 00:01:37,017
皮疹什么时候不是皮疹呢
When is a tuba-strap rash not a tuba-strap rash?

27
00:01:37,377 --> 00:01:39,156
当它是吻痕的时候
When it's hickeys.

28
00:01:39,756 --> 00:01:41,786
我们得限制你外出
You know, we're gonna have to ground you,

29
00:01:41,786 --> 00:01:43,906
不止这些哦
Oh, we're doing way more than that.

30
00:01:43,966 --> 00:01:46,266
兰登要赚回300块钱的罚款
Landon has a $300 fine to work off.

31
00:01:46,266 --> 00:01:48,426
这点我们可以争辩一下 就说条子有种族歧视
We could fight that -- say the cop was racist.

32
00:01:48,436 --> 00:01:50,656
即便我们输了 也会引发一场讨论
Even if we lose, it'll start a conversation.

33
00:01:50,656 --> 00:01:53,685
你犯了错误 就得付出代价 莱翁
You made a mistake, you pay the consequences, Levon.

34
00:01:54,065 --> 00:01:55,245
你的第一份工作就是清理
Your first job is cleaning out

35
00:01:55,245 --> 00:01:57,255
我为我的鸭子们建的完美小村庄
the awesome village I built for my ducks.

36
00:01:57,265 --> 00:01:58,225
不是老妈的鸭子吗
Aren't they mom's ducks?

37
00:01:58,225 --> 00:02:00,865
你真想现在来挑战我的极限吗
Do you really want to test me right now?!

38
00:02:01,445 --> 00:02:03,005
你 先生 慢慢做决定吧
Well, you, sir, take your time deciding.

39
00:02:03,005 --> 00:02:04,495
我们会像猎犬在木橱柜的阴影里
We'll be here just as sure as a coonhound

40
00:02:04,495 --> 00:02:06,894
夏日小憩一样待在这里一动不动
takes a summer nap in the shade of a Chifferobe.

41
00:02:06,894 --> 00:02:09,224
好了 你现在只是在随便背
Okay, now you're just randomly throwing words together

42
00:02:09,224 --> 00:02:10,604
《杀死一只知更鸟》里的台词罢了
from "To Kill a Mockingbird."

43
00:02:10,614 --> 00:02:13,194
今年农场的番茄获得了大丰收
It was a boon year for tomatoes on the farm,

44
00:02:13,194 --> 00:02:15,024
或者是我们所说的
or what we're calling...

45
00:02:16,164 --> 00:02:17,614
番大富
Tomatogeddon.

46
00:02:17,614 --> 00:02:20,083
所以他们做了超大一批的"塔克超有名"
So they made an extra-large batch of Tucker's Famous,

47
00:02:20,083 --> 00:02:21,673
我们要在农夫市集上卖掉
and we're selling it at the farmers' market.

48
00:02:21,673 --> 00:02:23,423
你说的"有名"
Now, when you say "Famous" --

49
00:02:23,423 --> 00:02:25,273
指的是全密苏里州境内有名
it's known Missouri-wide.

50
00:02:25,273 --> 00:02:28,023
一个死刑犯点名要在他的最后一餐上吃这个
A death-row inmate requested it for his last meal.

51
00:02:28,113 --> 00:02:29,523
至少我在努力卖啊
Well, at least I'm trying to sell.

52
00:02:29,523 --> 00:02:31,113
怎么了
What is going on?

53
00:02:31,113 --> 00:02:32,512
在买了那边卖的东西之后
After buying whatever they're selling,

54
00:02:32,512 --> 00:02:35,402
我猜人们没钱再买东西了吧
I'm guessing people are plum out of spending money.

55
00:02:36,252 --> 00:02:38,112
等等 不
Wait. No.

56
00:02:38,112 --> 00:02:40,032
是安德鲁和西蒙
It's Andrew and Simon.

57
00:02:40,032 --> 00:02:41,312
谢谢
Thank you.

58
00:02:42,022 --> 00:02:43,852
-你好呀 -你好
- Hello. - Oh, hello!

59
00:02:43,852 --> 00:02:46,681
要试试我们手抓手作的鳟鱼干吗
Here to try our hand-caught artisanal trout jerky?

60
00:02:46,681 --> 00:02:48,271
-不用了 -卖得跟烤饼一样好
- No. - It's selling like hotcakes.

61
00:02:48,271 --> 00:02:49,411
其实是更好
Actually, better.

62
00:02:49,411 --> 00:02:51,031
看到素食烤饼摊了吗
See the vegan hotcakes stand?

63
00:02:51,031 --> 00:02:53,251
就在订做蜂蜜摊旁边
Next to the bespoke honey stall.

64
00:02:53,261 --> 00:02:55,241
我们该小心点 这个市集可能是个陷阱
We should be careful. This market might be a trick

65
00:02:55,241 --> 00:02:57,721
把一堆白人都聚集到一个地方
to get a whole bunch of white people together in one spot.

66
00:02:57,721 --> 00:02:59,161
我其实很高兴你有来
I'm actually glad you're here.

67
00:02:59,171 --> 00:03:01,750
我们在找新的高级项目经理
We're looking for a new senior associate,

68
00:03:01,750 --> 00:03:03,280
我正打算找你
and I was gonna call you.

69
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:05,630
找我干什么 一个过气的人
Call me what? A has-been?

70
00:03:05,670 --> 00:03:07,370
"米事生非"吗
"Mitch ado about nothing"?

71
00:03:07,390 --> 00:03:08,590
我为什么要为你干你的活
Why am I doing your work for you?

72
00:03:08,590 --> 00:03:11,360
听着 从社交上 我觉得你真的不可救药了
Look, on a social level, I find you hopeless,

73
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:13,939
但我总觉得你是个好律师
But I always thought you were a good lawyer --

74
00:03:13,949 --> 00:03:16,239
如果到了对的律所 说不定就是个很厉害的律师了
Maybe a great one at the right firm.

75
00:03:16,249 --> 00:03:18,269
亲爱的 你有带别的现金盒吗
Honey, did you bring the other cash box?

76
00:03:18,269 --> 00:03:19,849
这个装满了
This one's filled up.

77
00:03:20,639 --> 00:03:22,079
考虑一下吧
Think about it.

78
00:03:24,289 --> 00:03:25,649
拜托 乔
Come on, Joe!

79
00:03:25,649 --> 00:03:27,568
我不想学
I don't want to learn!

80
00:03:27,568 --> 00:03:29,348
但你必须学
But you have to learn!

81
00:03:29,358 --> 00:03:30,938
非常简单
And it's so easy.

82
00:03:30,948 --> 00:03:34,648
听着 首先你要先做个小人
Look, first, you make the little man,

83
00:03:34,648 --> 00:03:37,898
然后你用绳子缠住他的喉咙
then you tie the rope around its throat --

84
00:03:37,898 --> 00:03:38,618
不要
No!

85
00:03:38,618 --> 00:03:40,777
乔 别担心系鞋带的事情
Joe, don't worry about tying your shoes.

86
00:03:40,777 --> 00:03:42,197
那是大男孩才做的
That's for big boys.

87
00:03:42,197 --> 00:03:43,697
别告诉他不行
Don't tell him he can't.

88
00:03:43,697 --> 00:03:45,157
他不行 但那不会怎么样
He can't, but he'll be fine --

89
00:03:45,157 --> 00:03:46,727
我们孩子有浓密美丽的头发
kid has thick, beautiful hair.

90
00:03:46,727 --> 00:03:48,617
-我可以继续工作了吗 -你在工作吗
- Can I get back to work now? - You're working?

91
00:03:48,617 --> 00:03:50,077
但现在又不是周一到周四的
But it's not between 10:00 and 2:00,

92
00:03:50,077 --> 00:03:51,047
10点到下午2点
Monday through Thursday.

93
00:03:51,047 --> 00:03:52,367
我本不打算告诉你们
Well, I wasn't gonna tell you guys,

94
00:03:52,377 --> 00:03:53,396
因为我知道你们又会小题大做
'cause I knew you'd make a big fuss,

95
00:03:53,396 --> 00:03:55,956
但商会要授予我
but the chamber of commerce is giving me

96
00:03:55,956 --> 00:03:57,386
工业巨人奖
a titans of industry award.

97
00:03:57,386 --> 00:03:59,436
他们请我们为庆典录个有关
They asked me to make a video for the ceremony

98
00:03:59,436 --> 00:04:01,126
我奋斗动力的视频
about what drives me.

99
00:04:01,676 --> 00:04:02,756
在经过了30年
After 30 years

100
00:04:02,756 --> 00:04:05,766
安装了成百上千万的吊衣杆后
and over a hundred thousand hanger rods installed,

101
00:04:05,766 --> 00:04:08,315
有些人会就此安定 放松一下
some people would kick back and relax.

102
00:04:08,575 --> 00:04:10,865
但我不会 我可是杰·普里契特
Not me. I'm Jay Pritchett.

103
00:04:11,385 --> 00:04:13,035
普里契特橱柜
Pritchett's closets.

104
00:04:13,545 --> 00:04:14,725
慢点慢点
Slow down!

105
00:04:14,885 --> 00:04:17,095
你需要多少橱柜
How many closets do you need?

106
00:04:17,585 --> 00:04:20,924
好的 我能搞定
Yeah. I can handle that.

107
00:04:21,274 --> 00:04:23,414
-好棒 -我要重新录
- It's great. - I'm starting over.

108
00:04:23,414 --> 00:04:24,944
-为什么 -你们觉得很无聊
- Why? - You guys were bored,

109
00:04:24,944 --> 00:04:27,794
这段视频明显没有体现我的精髓
and the video obviously doesn't capture my essence.

110
00:04:27,794 --> 00:04:30,744
你们觉得另一个巨人 漆布之王艾德·菲斯克
You think that fellow titan Ed Fisk, the lion of linoleum,

111
00:04:30,744 --> 00:04:32,014
也会犯这种错误吗
would make that mistake?

112
00:04:32,014 --> 00:04:33,213
这次活动有多盛大啊
How big is this event?

113
00:04:33,213 --> 00:04:34,973
会有红毯吗
Is there going to be a red carpet?

114
00:04:34,973 --> 00:04:37,723
没有 但是莱德[红]地毯的莱德·莫塔会去
No, but Red Murtaugh, of Red's carpets, will be there.

115
00:04:37,883 --> 00:04:40,493
我可是要跟一帮行业巨人并肩前行 歌洛莉亚
I'm walking with giants, Gloria,

116
00:04:40,543 --> 00:04:42,503
很容易因此被别人超越[踩到]
and that's a good way to get stepped on.

117
00:04:44,733 --> 00:04:45,933
那里有两个位置
Oh, there are two over there.

118
00:04:45,933 --> 00:04:48,552
太好了 我还以为我们永远找不到了
Oh, good. For a second, I didn't think we were gonna find...

119
00:04:48,982 --> 00:04:50,772
那不是贝丝和安迪吗
Hey, isn't that Beth and Andy?

120
00:04:51,702 --> 00:04:54,592
其实那两个位置更好一点
Um, actually, uh, those two are better.

121
00:04:54,592 --> 00:04:56,012
但那样我们会离得好远啊
But all those people would be between us.

122
00:04:56,012 --> 00:04:58,332
是啊 但是我们已经在一起一天了
Yeah, but, you know, we spent all day together.

123
00:04:58,332 --> 00:04:59,802
-我 -你们好呀
- I just -- - Hey. Hey, you two.

124
00:04:59,802 --> 00:05:02,351
安迪 你瘦下来了好棒啊
He y, Andy. Very cool you're not fat anymore.

125
00:05:02,351 --> 00:05:04,041
你们好 很高兴见到你们
Hi! Nice to see you guys!

126
00:05:04,041 --> 00:05:05,541
我们应该趁电影还没开始去找座位...
We really should go find seats before the m--

127
00:05:05,541 --> 00:05:07,101
请坐下
Sit down, please.

128
00:05:10,441 --> 00:05:12,171
安迪订婚后
Ever since Andy got engaged,

129
00:05:12,171 --> 00:05:14,240
我们之间就怪怪的
things between us have been weird.

130
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,340
就好像"一个想扯掉自己红头发的
Like "a woman with olive skin

131
00:05:15,340 --> 00:05:16,790
橄榄色肤色女人"那样诡异
trying to pull off red hair" weird.

132
00:05:16,790 --> 00:05:18,170
我只想赶紧看完电影
I just wanted to watch the movie

133
00:05:18,170 --> 00:05:20,330
在情况变尴尬前离开那里
and get out of there before it got awkward.

134
00:05:20,500 --> 00:05:21,990
我还在想念你
I still think about you.

135
00:05:21,990 --> 00:05:24,670
我也是 但我现在跟别人在一起了
Me too. But I'm with someone else now.

136
00:05:24,670 --> 00:05:25,450
我已经许下承诺了呃
I made a commitment.

137
00:05:25,450 --> 00:05:27,269
但你真的爱她吗
But do you really love her?

138
00:05:27,269 --> 00:05:28,349
僵尸
Zombie!

139
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:30,149
干掉了
Got it!

140
00:05:30,429 --> 00:05:33,809
我们早就应该告诉对方我们的真实想法
Anyway, we should have told each other how we felt.

141
00:05:35,459 --> 00:05:37,609
没感觉吗 真的吗
Nothing? Really?

142
00:05:38,259 --> 00:05:40,218
我恨不得越早离开越好
I could not get out of there fast enough.

143
00:05:40,228 --> 00:05:40,918
急什么啊
What's the rush?

144
00:05:40,918 --> 00:05:43,748
他们有时候会在演员名单后面弄个彩蛋
Sometimes they put a funny skit thing after all the names.

145
00:05:43,748 --> 00:05:45,078
你们俩等一下
Guys, wait up.

146
00:05:45,498 --> 00:05:47,358
你们想一起去隔壁吃个汉堡喝点啤酒吗
You want to go grab a burger and a beer next door?

147
00:05:47,358 --> 00:05:48,998
我当然想了
Well, I -- I definitely do.

148
00:05:48,998 --> 00:05:51,088
那部电影让我想到了太多
That movie brought up so much for me.

149
00:05:51,088 --> 00:05:52,948
另外 我的药不能空腹吃
Plus, I got to take my pill with food.

150
00:05:52,958 --> 00:05:55,237
-我不一定 -你要来哦
- Yeah, I'm not so sure -- - You're coming.

151
00:05:55,677 --> 00:05:56,637
说不定你来了
Maybe if you're there,

152
00:05:56,637 --> 00:05:58,897
他就不会为老板娘表演他可爱的
he won't try and do his adorable British character

153
00:05:58,897 --> 00:06:00,297
英国调调
for the hostess.

154
00:06:01,857 --> 00:06:03,367
你能把这个放到我的素汉堡里吗
Will you put this in my veggie burger

155
00:06:03,367 --> 00:06:05,267
别告诉我放在哪里了
and not tell me where it is?

156
00:06:07,416 --> 00:06:10,676
罗伊德 我是你爸 也是你最大的噩梦
Hey, Lloyd, it's your dad, A.K.A. your worst nightmare.

157
00:06:10,676 --> 00:06:12,506
只是想提醒你一下你得把鸭村
Just reminding you the duck village

158
00:06:12,506 --> 00:06:14,076
洗到能在里面盛食物吃的程度
needs to be clean enough to eat off of.

159
00:06:14,086 --> 00:06:15,776
听到了吗 最好没听到
You hear me? You better not have.

160
00:06:15,776 --> 00:06:17,156
因为你不被允许使用电话
You're not allowed to use your phone.

161
00:06:17,166 --> 00:06:18,736
没错 我无处不在
Yep, I'm everywhere.

162
00:06:19,726 --> 00:06:22,315
你对卢克是不是有点太严厉了
You think maybe you're being a bit hard on Luke?

163
00:06:22,315 --> 00:06:23,065
我们是他父母 克莱尔
We're his parents, Claire.

164
00:06:23,065 --> 00:06:24,875
防止他走向歧途是我们的责任
It's our job to keep him off the stripper pole.

165
00:06:24,875 --> 00:06:27,775
其实我挺喜欢他有点小叛逆的
I actually like that he's being a little bit rebellious.

166
00:06:27,775 --> 00:06:30,135
偶尔 除了玩魔术和蹦床之外
Sometimes, between the magic and the trampolining,

167
00:06:30,135 --> 00:06:33,964
我觉得他有点 你懂的
I think he's getting a little... you know.

168
00:06:33,964 --> 00:06:35,404
你想说什么 克莱尔
What are you trying to say, Claire?

169
00:06:35,404 --> 00:06:37,414
有点 像我吗
A little...me?

170
00:06:38,084 --> 00:06:38,924
又来了
There it was again,

171
00:06:38,924 --> 00:06:41,644
她在影射我不够坏
the insinuation that I'm not dangerous enough for her.

172
00:06:41,644 --> 00:06:44,384
很明显 她忘了我曾经进过监狱
Apparently, she's forgotten I've been to jail.

173
00:06:45,224 --> 00:06:48,103
我曾经在翻跟斗疗法课堂上带过二十名犯人
I once led 20 violent inmates in a therapeutic tumbling class.

174
00:06:48,103 --> 00:06:49,663
获得了巨大成功
It was a huge success.

175
00:06:49,983 --> 00:06:52,213
我当时能把参与奖杯做得
Could I have made the participation trophies

176
00:06:52,213 --> 00:06:53,733
不那么锋利吗
a little less stabby?

177
00:06:53,823 --> 00:06:54,793
当然
Sure.

178
00:06:54,793 --> 00:06:57,843
不过总之 巨大的成功
But overall, a huge success.

179
00:06:57,903 --> 00:07:01,192
你说你喜欢卢克的叛逆...
When you say you're happy about Luke being a rebel...

180
00:07:01,292 --> 00:07:02,592
你喷了我的香水吗
Are you wearing my perfume?

181
00:07:02,592 --> 00:07:04,282
是为了吸引鸭子们
It was to trick the ducks.

182
00:07:04,292 --> 00:07:06,162
像我刚才说的...
But like I was saying --

183
00:07:06,162 --> 00:07:07,992
那是艾丽克斯吗
Hey, is that Alex?

184
00:07:07,992 --> 00:07:09,202
是啊 真奇怪
It is. That's weird.

185
00:07:09,202 --> 00:07:12,162
她说整个周末都要待在学校学习
She said she was gonna be at school all weekend studying.

186
00:07:13,252 --> 00:07:14,111
喂
Hello?

187
00:07:14,111 --> 00:07:15,281
亲爱的
Hey, honey.

188
00:07:15,431 --> 00:07:17,081
我也在 你怎么样啊 亲爱的
I'm here, too. How are you doing, honey?

189
00:07:17,081 --> 00:07:20,401
我很好 在干活呢 真是超级忙
Oh, yeah, I'm good. I'm doing some work. Really busy.

190
00:07:20,421 --> 00:07:21,981
真有意思 因为...
Well, that's interesting, be--

191
00:07:21,981 --> 00:07:24,261
是啊 我们今天也很无聊
Yeah, we've got a boring day ahead of us, too.

192
00:07:24,261 --> 00:07:26,591
现在要去扣押车辆停车场取车
Heading down to the impound lot to pick up the car

193
00:07:26,591 --> 00:07:29,610
因为没错 你弟昨晚被警察抓了
because, yes, your brother got arrested last night.

194
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:31,460
是吗 真好
Oh! Okay. Well, that's great.

195
00:07:31,460 --> 00:07:33,640
我得挂了 我东西还放在图书馆呢
Yeah, I really got to go. I left my stuff in the library.

196
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:35,640
我超担心有人会偷我的零食
And I'm really worried someone's gonna steal my snacks.

197
00:07:35,640 --> 00:07:36,860
就这样 挂了
Okay, bye!

198
00:07:37,010 --> 00:07:38,770
你干嘛拦我 我差点就能抓她现行了
Why did you stop me? I was gonna bust her.

199
00:07:38,770 --> 00:07:41,279
怎么 一个小谎言而已 拜托
What? In a little lie? I mean, come on.

200
00:07:41,279 --> 00:07:42,889
她可能是去朋友家
She's probably visiting a friend

201
00:07:42,889 --> 00:07:44,259
只不过不想让我们难过而已
and she didn't want to hurt our feelings.

202
00:07:44,259 --> 00:07:46,689
她听到卢克被拘留几乎毫无反应
She barely reacted when she heard that Lluke got arrested.

203
00:07:46,689 --> 00:07:48,329
她肯定有什么秘密
She's obviously hiding something.

204
00:07:48,329 --> 00:07:50,409
她现在居然进卖酒的地方了
And now she's walking into that liquor store.

205
00:07:50,409 --> 00:07:52,909
天哪 这样就严重了
Oh, no. Oh, no. Now, this is serious.

206
00:07:52,909 --> 00:07:54,089
一个大学生去朋友家玩
A college student is visiting a friend,

207
00:07:54,089 --> 00:07:56,248
他们还买了啤酒
and they're buying beer!

208
00:07:56,248 --> 00:07:57,468
放松 菲尔
Relax, Phil.

209
00:07:57,478 --> 00:07:58,928
这女孩都有两个专利了
This girl has two patents.

210
00:07:58,928 --> 00:08:00,638
可她需要的是两位父母
What she needs is two parents.

211
00:08:00,638 --> 00:08:04,648
好吧 我想说少管艾丽克斯一点也没什么
Okay, my point is, it wouldn't hurt Alex to loosen up.

212
00:08:04,648 --> 00:08:07,008
我担心她会变得有点...
I mean, I'm worried that she's getting a little...

213
00:08:07,018 --> 00:08:08,487
又来了
There it is again.

214
00:08:08,487 --> 00:08:10,067
直说吧 克莱尔
Just say it, Claire --

215
00:08:10,157 --> 00:08:11,487
你希望我们的孩子能野一点
You like our kids running wild

216
00:08:11,487 --> 00:08:12,627
因为你担心他们变得
'cause you're worried they're too much

217
00:08:12,627 --> 00:08:14,057
太像他们懦弱自卑的爸爸
like their namby-pamby dad,

218
00:08:14,057 --> 00:08:16,207
老好人先生 平凡市市长
Mr. Goody-goody, Mayor of vanillatown.

219
00:08:16,207 --> 00:08:18,047
是因为鸭子喜欢我更多你才不高兴吗
Is this 'cause the ducks like me better?

220
00:08:18,057 --> 00:08:20,417
这是生物学现象 你知道的
That is biological, and you know it.

221
00:08:20,417 --> 00:08:21,796
网上还有它们
There are videos of them online

222
00:08:21,796 --> 00:08:23,206
跟着吸尘器到处跑的视频呢
following around a vacuum cleaner.

223
00:08:23,206 --> 00:08:24,456
它们就是一群白痴
They're basically idiots!

224
00:08:24,456 --> 00:08:26,666
天哪 等等 她要上那辆面包车
Oh, my god. Hang on. She's getting into that van.

225
00:08:26,666 --> 00:08:28,516
-现在我们能担心了 -没错 我很担心
- Oh, now we're concerned! - Yes, I'm concerned!

226
00:08:28,516 --> 00:08:30,016
那是辆破烂的修理面包车
That is a sketchy repair van

227
00:08:30,016 --> 00:08:31,956
开车的很可能是她在网上遇到的那种
that is probably being driven by some middle-aged pervert

228
00:08:31,956 --> 00:08:34,236
留着一根长指甲的中年变态
with one long fingernail that she met online.

229
00:08:34,236 --> 00:08:36,615
天哪 快点 跟上他们
Oh, my god, go! Follow them!

230
00:08:37,585 --> 00:08:39,435
多谢你把曼尼的画架借给我们
Thank you for lending us Manny's easel.

231
00:08:39,435 --> 00:08:41,295
大家都喜欢那个酱吗
Did everyone love the sauce?

232
00:08:41,295 --> 00:08:42,935
如果大家是指一千只蜜蜂
Well, if by "everyone" you mean a thousand bees

233
00:08:42,935 --> 00:08:45,725
以及一匹逃出马圈的小马驹的话 是的
and a pony that escaped from the riding circle, yeah.

234
00:08:47,015 --> 00:08:47,924
不是吧
Oh, no --

235
00:08:47,924 --> 00:08:49,714
你是要录那种视频遗嘱
Is this video wills where you make us compete

236
00:08:49,714 --> 00:08:51,214
好让我们在寻宝游戏里争抢你的遗产吗
in a scavenger hunt for your inheritance?

237
00:08:51,214 --> 00:08:54,164
不 是为了我的泰坦奖 我告诉过你的
No. It's the video for my Titan award. I told you about it.

238
00:08:54,164 --> 00:08:56,364
我在尝试展现力量和自信
I'm trying to project strength and confidence.

239
00:08:56,364 --> 00:08:56,984
也许你该先把壁炉上
Maybe you should lose

240
00:08:56,984 --> 00:08:59,484
写着"我恨周一"的加菲猫杯拿下来
the Garfield "I hate Mondays" mug on the mantel.

241
00:08:59,484 --> 00:09:00,344
说得好
Good catch.

242
00:09:00,344 --> 00:09:02,143
我等你说这句话等了一辈子
I've waited my whole life to hear you say those words.

243
00:09:02,153 --> 00:09:03,573
-想来帮我一下吗 -当然
- Want to help me out here? - Yeah.

244
00:09:03,583 --> 00:09:04,833
我需要转移一下注意力
I needed the distraction.

245
00:09:04,833 --> 00:09:06,203
我这一整天都在纠结
I had spent enough of my day

246
00:09:06,203 --> 00:09:07,833
西蒙的工作邀请
obsessing over Simon's job offer.

247
00:09:07,833 --> 00:09:09,303
另外 我不知道
Plus, I don't know --

248
00:09:09,303 --> 00:09:10,903
看到我强大的老爸
seeing my big, strong dad

249
00:09:10,913 --> 00:09:12,533
用这么柔弱的姿态请我帮忙
reach out to me in a vulnerable way,

250
00:09:12,533 --> 00:09:14,543
我有点 感动
it was -- it was kind of touching.

251
00:09:14,543 --> 00:09:16,782
红色按键 你怎么可能看不到
The red button! How do you not see it?!

252
00:09:16,782 --> 00:09:18,912
你没来之前我拿扫把都能开机
Before you got here, I was turning it on with a broom!

253
00:09:18,912 --> 00:09:21,852
算了 吃午饭吧
Now just -- forget it. Let's get lunch.

254
00:09:21,852 --> 00:09:23,602
-我只要... -跟我来
If I could just -- - Come with me!

255
00:09:24,292 --> 00:09:26,242
好 把酱含在嘴里 轻轻搅动
Okay, hold the sauce in your mouth, swirl it around --

256
00:09:26,242 --> 00:09:28,871
让它覆盖你的舌面 然后吞下去
really coat your tongue. Now swallow.

257
00:09:29,731 --> 00:09:31,931
-不错吧 -好多了
- Right? - Much better.

258
00:09:31,931 --> 00:09:33,311
杰 你吃这个酱的时候
Okay, Jay, what you're gonna want to do

259
00:09:33,311 --> 00:09:35,131
最好先含在嘴里 再...
is hold the sauce in your mouth, sw--

260
00:09:35,131 --> 00:09:36,671
我知道怎么吃
I know how eating works.

261
00:09:37,891 --> 00:09:38,921
-还不赖嘛 -谢谢
- Not too shabby. - Thank you.

262
00:09:38,921 --> 00:09:41,630
歌洛莉亚过世的姑姑也挺会做酱汁的
You know who else makes a mean sauce is Gloria's dead aunt.

263
00:09:41,630 --> 00:09:42,340
那边就有
Oh, there it is right there.

264
00:09:42,340 --> 00:09:43,890
你试试 我跟你说 好吃爆了
Try some. I'm telling you, it's life-changing.

265
00:09:43,890 --> 00:09:45,600
我觉得我们不需要两种酱
I don't think we really need two sauces.

266
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:46,890
而且如果你的调味酱来自...
And sometimes, when you have sauces from --

267
00:09:46,890 --> 00:09:48,010
你尝一下
Now you eat.

268
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:51,530
天哪 真的太好吃了
Oh, my god. That is amazing.

269
00:09:51,530 --> 00:09:52,640
这个秘密配方
It's a secret recipe

270
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:55,199
在我们家族传了几代了
that has been in my family for generations.

271
00:09:55,199 --> 00:09:56,729
你的家传酱在建国两百周年纪念日
Was your sauce buried in a local time capsule

272
00:09:56,729 --> 00:09:59,299
被装进当地时间胶囊了吗 我的酱是哦
during the bicentennial? Because mine was.

273
00:09:59,299 --> 00:10:02,509
我的伯祖母米兰达曾是唯一会做这个酱的人
My great-aunt Miranda was the only one that could make it,

274
00:10:02,509 --> 00:10:04,459
而因为我是家族里没有嫁给秘鲁人的
and because I was the oldest girl

275
00:10:04,459 --> 00:10:06,009
年龄最大的女儿
that didn't marry a Peruvian,

276
00:10:06,129 --> 00:10:07,789
这个秘方被传给了我
the recipe passed down to me.

277
00:10:07,789 --> 00:10:09,148
-把酱给我 -好吧
- Sauce me. - Right.

278
00:10:09,148 --> 00:10:10,748
这个房子里没有多少东西
Ay, I don't have many things

279
00:10:10,748 --> 00:10:13,028
跟哥伦比亚有关的东西
that remind me of Colombia here in the house,

280
00:10:13,028 --> 00:10:13,878
不过现在有了
but now I do.

281
00:10:13,878 --> 00:10:15,268
我们酱的配方超级秘密
Legend has it our sauce was so secret,

282
00:10:15,268 --> 00:10:16,998
只被写在了一个地方
it was only written down one place.

283
00:10:16,998 --> 00:10:19,108
我们从小到大每周日都吃这个
We grew up eating this every Sunday,

284
00:10:19,108 --> 00:10:21,178
现在曼尼和乔也会吃了
and now Manny and Joe will, too.

285
00:10:21,188 --> 00:10:23,087
它被反向纹在了一个跛脚的马僮身上
It was tattooed backwards on a lame stable boy.

286
00:10:23,087 --> 00:10:24,667
你只能从镜子读出来
You could only read it in a mirror.

287
00:10:24,667 --> 00:10:25,927
我能看一下你的配方吗
Mm, can I see that recipe?

288
00:10:25,927 --> 00:10:27,827
我觉得你读出来会很失礼
Uh, uh, well, I think it's a little bit rude to read --

289
00:10:28,317 --> 00:10:29,277
你撞到我的手了
Ay! You bumped my hand!

290
00:10:29,277 --> 00:10:30,927
你毁了它 不是吧
You've ruined it! No!

291
00:10:30,927 --> 00:10:32,327
不 我能把它弄干
No, no! I can dry it! I can dry it!

292
00:10:32,327 --> 00:10:33,297
不 墨水都花了 小卡
No, now the ink's running. Cam!

293
00:10:33,297 --> 00:10:37,016
不 你又把我伯祖父的餐巾给毁了
No, and now you have ruined my great-uncle's napkins!

294
00:10:37,016 --> 00:10:39,276
这桌上的东西都有特殊含义吗
It's okay, does everything at this table have meaning?

295
00:10:40,416 --> 00:10:41,906
抱歉我来晚了
Hey, sorry I'm late.

296
00:10:41,906 --> 00:10:43,156
我的新欢瑞秋需要我帮忙
My new lady, Rachel, needed help

297
00:10:43,156 --> 00:10:45,556
选一条短裤好气气她继父
picking a pair of shorts to make her stepdad mad.

298
00:10:45,686 --> 00:10:47,116
我在想哪个更讽刺
I wonder what's more of a "Screw you" --

299
00:10:47,116 --> 00:10:49,645
是你给我讲这个故事 还是这群蠢鸭子
you telling me that story or that the ducks now stare at me

300
00:10:49,645 --> 00:10:51,645
一边往浴室走一边盯着我
while they slowly go to the bathroom?

301
00:10:51,645 --> 00:10:53,335
你们家不是有三只鸭子的吗
Didn't you guys have three ducks?

302
00:10:53,335 --> 00:10:55,295
是啊 一只 两只
Yeah -- one, two...

303
00:10:55,295 --> 00:10:56,265
糟糕了
Oh, no.

304
00:10:57,285 --> 00:10:57,885
不好
Dude!

305
00:10:57,895 --> 00:10:59,205
糟了
No, no, no, no, no, no!

306
00:11:00,145 --> 00:11:01,255
他去哪里了
Where did he go?

307
00:11:01,855 --> 00:11:04,224
我们可以试试这个鸭叫软件
Hey, look, there's a duck-call app we can use.

308
00:11:05,744 --> 00:11:07,444
可千万别吵到她
Oh, crap. Not her.

309
00:11:07,444 --> 00:11:08,644
这位是什么情况
What happened with this one?

310
00:11:08,644 --> 00:11:11,064
我跟她处了一阵
Well, I was seeing her for a while,

311
00:11:11,064 --> 00:11:12,544
后来她把我回绝了
then she pulled her shade down.

312
00:11:12,544 --> 00:11:14,304
真经典 准备好
Classy. Get ready.

313
00:11:18,623 --> 00:11:19,613
快闪
Scatter!

314
00:11:20,593 --> 00:11:21,843
你在干什么
What the hell are you doing?

315
00:11:21,843 --> 00:11:24,233
你是在偷拍我穿比基尼睡觉的图片吗
Are you taking pictures of me sleeping in a bikini?

316
00:11:24,233 --> 00:11:26,843
不 我只是想试着把这只可怜的小鸭子
No! I was just trying to lure that little duckling

317
00:11:26,853 --> 00:11:28,762
引回我朋友家的院子
back into my friend's yard.

318
00:11:29,292 --> 00:11:31,152
天哪
Oh, my God!

319
00:11:31,432 --> 00:11:33,172
-它太可爱了 -谢谢
- It's so cute! - Thank you.

320
00:11:33,172 --> 00:11:35,552
你还专门来找他 真是太贴心了
You're adorable for looking after him.

321
00:11:36,082 --> 00:11:38,682
我觉得我好像在学校见过你
Hey, you know, I think I've seen you around school before.

322
00:11:38,752 --> 00:11:40,242
-我叫塔米 -我是曼尼
- I'm Tammy. - Manny.

323
00:11:40,242 --> 00:11:41,732
这都行啊
You have got to be kidding me.

324
00:11:42,561 --> 00:11:44,391
是什么让杰·普里契特一路前行
What drives Jay Pritchett?

325
00:11:44,631 --> 00:11:46,881
是永不重复自我的欲望
A desire never to repeat himself.

326
00:11:46,881 --> 00:11:48,151
我要再来一遍
Let me do that again.

327
00:11:48,741 --> 00:11:51,481
是什么让杰·普里契特一路前行 奥迪轿车
What drives Jay Pritchett? An Audi.

328
00:11:51,481 --> 00:11:53,111
我要说个笑话来开场吗 我要模仿莱德·莫塔
I'm gonna start with a joke? I'm following Red Murtaugh.

329
00:11:53,111 --> 00:11:54,321
他太搞笑了
The man's hilarious.

330
00:11:54,321 --> 00:11:55,930
你看过他在那个广告里扮成小婴儿吧
You've seen him be that baby in his ads.

331
00:11:55,930 --> 00:11:56,470
提醒你一下
Just so you know,

332
00:11:56,470 --> 00:11:58,250
摄影机的电池只够用11个小时 所以
the camera only has 11 hours of battery, so...

333
00:11:58,250 --> 00:11:59,280
来验收一下吧
Let's see what we've got.

334
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:00,200
好
Yep.

335
00:12:01,350 --> 00:12:03,500
我为什么看起来这么苍白 还汗津津的
Why do I look so pale and sweaty?

336
00:12:03,500 --> 00:12:06,060
因为你老了 还有爱尔兰血统
Oh, well, you're old and Irish.

337
00:12:08,550 --> 00:12:10,819
歌洛莉亚 我只是想跟你说
Gloria, again, I just want to say that I'm--

338
00:12:10,819 --> 00:12:12,619
想说你很抱歉 你说过了
You're sorry? You told me.

339
00:12:12,619 --> 00:12:16,099
是啊 你要原谅我 那是个意外
Yes, and, uh -- excuse me -- that it was an accident.

340
00:12:16,149 --> 00:12:17,119
真的是意外吗
Was it?

341
00:12:17,119 --> 00:12:18,739
当然是意外
Yes, of course.

342
00:12:18,869 --> 00:12:21,399
我觉得是意外 我也说不清
I think. I -- I don't know.

343
00:12:21,429 --> 00:12:24,408
你毁掉了我的孩子接触他们过去的机会
you have destroyed my children's connection to their past,

344
00:12:24,408 --> 00:12:26,278
然后你觉得自己可能是故意的
and you might have done it on purpose?

345
00:12:26,278 --> 00:12:26,818
对不起
I'm sorry.

346
00:12:26,818 --> 00:12:29,598
安德鲁在农夫集市上羞辱了我
Andrew humiliated me today at the farmers' market,

347
00:12:29,598 --> 00:12:32,178
我一直为了酱的事情跟别人竞争
and I've always been sauce-competitive...

348
00:12:32,358 --> 00:12:34,718
让我帮你重新把它做出来
Look, just let me help you re-create it.

349
00:12:34,728 --> 00:12:37,677
我只在八岁的时候看我阿姨做过一次
I saw my aunt make it once when I was 8 years old.

350
00:12:37,677 --> 00:12:39,807
你以为我会记得吗
You think I'm going to remember--

351
00:12:40,647 --> 00:12:42,427
-芫荽 -什么
- Cilantro! - What?

352
00:12:42,427 --> 00:12:45,877
刚才那辆车逆火的声音听起来像枪声
That car backfiring, it sounded like gunshots.

353
00:12:45,977 --> 00:12:49,396
我记得我还是个小女孩时 坐在阿姨的厨房里
I remember when I was a little girl in my aunt's kitchen,

354
00:12:49,396 --> 00:12:52,956
她用力地剁芫荽 发出很大的声音
and she started chopping the cilantro really loud

355
00:12:52,956 --> 00:12:54,856
这样我们就听不见外面的声音
so that we couldn't hear the noise.

356
00:12:54,856 --> 00:12:56,806
你还记得什么
Yes, okay. Well, what else do you remember?

357
00:12:56,806 --> 00:12:58,616
记不得了 小卡 已经过了30年
Well, nothing, Cam. It was 30 years ago.

358
00:12:58,616 --> 00:13:01,646
那份食谱就在你心里 你只是需要把它找出来
No, the recipe is inside you! It just needs to come out!

359
00:13:01,716 --> 00:13:03,625
妈妈 我找到了
Mommy, I found it.

360
00:13:04,885 --> 00:13:06,975
-柠檬汁 -什么
- Lemon juice! - What?

361
00:13:06,985 --> 00:13:09,565
看吧 我说过了只是早晚的事
Oh, see? I told you it's just a matter of time!

362
00:13:09,915 --> 00:13:11,445
刺山柑 墨西哥辣椒
Capers, Jalapeno,

363
00:13:11,445 --> 00:13:13,355
还有一点点黑胡椒
and a dash of black pepper!

364
00:13:15,415 --> 00:13:16,854
我觉得真是很悲哀
It's just so sad.

365
00:13:16,864 --> 00:13:18,604
男主角决定跟一个他完全不爱的僵尸
The guy decides to spend the rest of his life

366
00:13:18,604 --> 00:13:20,904
过完余下的一生
with some zombie he doesn't love.

367
00:13:21,204 --> 00:13:22,304
你们的桌已经准备好了
Your table is ready.

368
00:13:22,304 --> 00:13:24,364
太好了 一大筐薯条[模仿英国腔]
Smashing! A bucket of chips--

369
00:13:24,364 --> 00:13:25,674
今天你就别给我闹了
We're not doing that.

370
00:13:26,424 --> 00:13:27,134
好吧
Okay.

371
00:13:27,144 --> 00:13:29,214
我就问你一句
Hey, um, real quick--

372
00:13:29,214 --> 00:13:30,453
为什么跟我一起看刚才的电影
why wasn't it more uncomfortable

373
00:13:30,453 --> 00:13:31,673
你一点反应也没有
for you to watch that movie?

374
00:13:31,673 --> 00:13:34,053
因为僵尸杀了我爸妈
Right. Because zombies killed my parents.

375
00:13:34,053 --> 00:13:34,873
随你了
Oh, never mind.

376
00:13:34,873 --> 00:13:36,593
我都忘了你根本没法成熟起来
I forgot you can't have an adult conversation.

377
00:13:36,593 --> 00:13:38,143
别走 听我说
No, okay, yes.

378
00:13:38,143 --> 00:13:40,683
如果几个月前我们一起看那部电影
If -- if we would have watched that movie a few months ago,

379
00:13:40,683 --> 00:13:43,252
我会觉得很尴尬 但是
it would have been really weird, but...

380
00:13:43,752 --> 00:13:44,972
我们现在不是挺好的吗
we're all good now, right?

381
00:13:44,972 --> 00:13:47,992
是啊 我们没问题了
Oh, yeah. No, I mean, I am good.

382
00:13:47,992 --> 00:13:50,252
迪伦和我已经重归于好
Dylan and I picked up right where we left off.

383
00:13:50,252 --> 00:13:52,132
我就是问问你怎么样
I was just checking on you.

384
00:13:52,132 --> 00:13:54,892
因为有一阵你有点不对
Cause for a while there, you were getting a little, uh...

385
00:13:57,741 --> 00:13:58,631
是啊
Yeah.

386
00:13:58,631 --> 00:13:59,941
贝丝在我身边呢
Beth stood by me.

387
00:14:00,101 --> 00:14:02,001
站的比谁都近
Well, you know, as close as she could.

388
00:14:02,491 --> 00:14:04,651
所以我知道我选对人了
That's when I knew I was with the right person.

389
00:14:04,651 --> 00:14:05,631
别误解我
And -- and don't get me wrong --

390
00:14:05,631 --> 00:14:08,921
我还是喜欢你的
I was -- I was pretty hung up on you.

391
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:11,610
但当我脑海里只剩下最后一个人的时候
But once I got it down to only one woman in my head,

392
00:14:11,610 --> 00:14:13,480
我看到贝丝完全不同的一面
I saw Beth in a whole new way,

393
00:14:13,490 --> 00:14:15,240
因此我们的关系才能继续发展
and we were able to move forward.

394
00:14:15,930 --> 00:14:17,450
我理解
That makes sense.

395
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:19,350
我为你高兴
I'm happy for you.

396
00:14:21,270 --> 00:14:23,419
看看我们 落难兄妹[模仿英国腔]
Look at us, brother and sister,

397
00:14:23,419 --> 00:14:24,399
自幼与父母分离[模仿英国腔]
separated from our mum...

398
00:14:24,399 --> 00:14:27,379
你演的太好了
Oh, you're so good at that.

399
00:14:28,299 --> 00:14:29,139
你有没有想过
Hey, what do you think about

400
00:14:29,139 --> 00:14:31,029
邀请海莉和迪伦来参加婚礼
inviting Haley and Dylan to the wedding?

401
00:14:31,839 --> 00:14:33,299
很好啊
I love that idea.

402
00:14:33,679 --> 00:14:35,559
而且是你提出来的 真是太好了
And I love you for having it.

403
00:14:37,318 --> 00:14:39,958
你说为什么现在的人不说"赶巧儿了"
Why do you think people stopped saying "Coinkydink"?

404
00:14:41,188 --> 00:14:42,578
迪伦 我
Dylan, um...

405
00:14:42,578 --> 00:14:43,698
天哪
Oh, God.

406
00:14:44,008 --> 00:14:45,888
你又要跟我分手了对不对
You're breaking up with me again, aren't you?

407
00:14:45,888 --> 00:14:47,748
抱歉 我
I'm sorry. I just -- I --

408
00:14:47,748 --> 00:14:50,177
我觉得安迪和贝丝
I feel like Andy and Beth

409
00:14:50,177 --> 00:14:52,447
还有所有人 大家的关系都在发展[前进]
and everyone in the world are moving forward,

410
00:14:52,447 --> 00:14:53,657
只有我们反而倒退
and we're moving backward.

411
00:14:53,657 --> 00:14:55,257
我们要停下来
Actually, we're stopping,

412
00:14:55,257 --> 00:14:56,937
因为我要下车
because I want to get out of the car.

413
00:14:56,937 --> 00:14:58,957
-迪伦 -停车
- Dylan-- - Stop!

414
00:14:59,697 --> 00:15:01,517
我受够了这样被你耍着玩
I'm tired of being jerked around.

415
00:15:03,386 --> 00:15:05,406
我也要前进了
Now I'm moving forward, too.

416
00:15:05,406 --> 00:15:06,966
你好歹叫个优步吧
Can't you at least call an Uber?

417
00:15:06,966 --> 00:15:10,216
因为我老是跟司机闲聊 已经上了黑名单了
You know they banned me for talking too much to the drivers!

418
00:15:11,146 --> 00:15:13,606
她还是不接电话 我不敢相信我们居然跟丢了
She's still not answering. I can't believe we lost them.

419
00:15:13,606 --> 00:15:16,496
我们就要到家了 我可以在电脑上定位她的手机
We're almost home. I can track her phone from the computer.

420
00:15:16,765 --> 00:15:17,575
"我希望你能电脑定位成功
"I hope you can track her phone

421
00:15:17,575 --> 00:15:18,905
因为你连辆面包车都跟不住"
better than you tracked that van."

422
00:15:18,905 --> 00:15:21,315
抱歉 克莱尔 就因为我有1/64的彻罗基血统
I'm sorry, Claire. Just because I'm 1/64th Cherokee,

423
00:15:21,325 --> 00:15:22,915
不代表我天生擅长追踪
it doesn't make me a natural tracker.

424
00:15:22,915 --> 00:15:24,505
你发现我没在追究这事了吧
You realize I'm not participating in this.

425
00:15:24,505 --> 00:15:26,355
是啊 你已经说得很清楚 因为我开车太娘
Well, you made it pretty clear it was my fault we lost them

426
00:15:26,355 --> 00:15:28,395
所以我把他们跟丢了
due to my less-than-manly driving.

427
00:15:28,395 --> 00:15:30,494
-我的天 -是啊 我又开始了
- Oh, my God. - Yes, this again.

428
00:15:30,494 --> 00:15:32,154
除非你承认我是个男人 不然我不会停的
I'm not letting it go till you admit that you wish I was a --

429
00:15:32,154 --> 00:15:33,854
菲尔 是那辆面包车
Phil, it's the van!

430
00:15:34,314 --> 00:15:36,814
-在我们家门口 -不好
- In my own house?! - Oh, no!

431
00:15:36,864 --> 00:15:39,504
-先别急 -别拦我 克莱尔
- Okay, now, hang on. - Don't hold me back, claire!

432
00:15:39,504 --> 00:15:41,194
虽然我只有1/64彻罗基血统
I may be one 1/64th Cherokee,

433
00:15:41,194 --> 00:15:44,873
但我的63/64是个愤怒的白人老爸
but I'm also 63/64ths crazy white guy!

434
00:15:46,153 --> 00:15:46,833
他人呢
Where is he?!

435
00:15:46,833 --> 00:15:47,673
-你还好吗 -你在说什么啊
- Are you okay? - What are you talking about?

436
00:15:47,673 --> 00:15:49,543
-你没事吧 -我没事啊
- Are you okay? -I-I-I'm fine.

437
00:15:49,823 --> 00:15:52,023
-我很抱歉 -你是该抱歉了
- No, I'm sorry! I-I -- - You are now!

438
00:15:54,723 --> 00:15:55,593
鲁本
Reuben?

439
00:15:55,593 --> 00:15:58,602
天哪 我把鲁本杀了
Oh, my God! I killed Reuben!

440
00:15:59,092 --> 00:16:00,352
宝贝
Oh, babe?

441
00:16:00,352 --> 00:16:01,902
出什么事了 流血了诶
What's going on? That's blood.

442
00:16:02,372 --> 00:16:06,422
我得辩解一下 我没想到有人能发现
In my defense, I didn't think anyone would ever find out.

443
00:16:07,102 --> 00:16:08,122
坚持住 鲁本
Stay with me, Reuben!

444
00:16:08,122 --> 00:16:11,471
好吧 原来开面包车去接你的是鲁本吗
Okay, so Reuben is the one who picked you up in the van?

445
00:16:11,471 --> 00:16:13,861
是的 那是他爸的车 天哪
Yes, it was his dad's -- oh, my god!

446
00:16:13,861 --> 00:16:14,881
你们在跟踪我吗
Have you been following me?

447
00:16:14,881 --> 00:16:17,431
他缓过来了 他会没事的
He's coming to. He's gonna be fine.

448
00:16:17,431 --> 00:16:18,511
不 不要
No! No!

449
00:16:18,511 --> 00:16:20,161
别想把过错推到我们身上
Don't try and make this our fault.

450
00:16:20,161 --> 00:16:22,251
去酒水商店的那个人是你
You are the one who went to the liquor store

451
00:16:22,251 --> 00:16:23,411
你买了什么
and bought - what?

452
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:25,180
冰
Ice.

453
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:29,110
罗本今天玩魁地奇的时候小腿扯着了
Reuben sprained his hamstring today while playing Quidditch.

454
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:31,290
宝贝 别误会我的意思 可你跟鲁本
Honey, don't take this the wrong way, but Reuben?

455
00:16:31,290 --> 00:16:32,690
-我们相爱了 -闭嘴吧
- We're in love. - Oh, shut up.

456
00:16:32,690 --> 00:16:33,690
不 别停 继续说话
No, no, no, keep talking!

457
00:16:33,690 --> 00:16:35,110
还记得我们来之前发生了什么吗
Remember what happened when you tripped and fell

458
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:36,330
你怎么被绊倒的
right before we got here?

459
00:16:36,340 --> 00:16:38,189
你知道吗 在加州理工真的很累
You know what? Caltech is hard.

460
00:16:38,189 --> 00:16:40,679
身边有那么多的天才 我又跟桑杰分手了
Between all the geniuses and breaking up with Sanjay,

461
00:16:40,679 --> 00:16:42,379
我只想跟让我觉得舒服的人在一起
I just wanted something comfortable,

462
00:16:42,379 --> 00:16:44,939
即使他是个崇拜我的小呆瓜跟屁虫
even if it is a wormy little dork that worships me.

463
00:16:44,939 --> 00:16:46,949
宝贝 我能理解
Oh, honey, I understand.

464
00:16:46,949 --> 00:16:48,809
真是有其母必有其女
Oh, like mother, like daughter, I guess.

465
00:16:48,809 --> 00:16:49,999
好了 他会没事的
Okay. He's gonna be fine.

466
00:16:49,999 --> 00:16:51,878
菲尔 过来跟我聊几句
Phil, come over here and talk to me for a second.

467
00:16:52,978 --> 00:16:54,778
我想我们该做的事已经做完了
Well, I guess we're done with my thing already.

468
00:16:54,778 --> 00:16:57,478
如果有那么一瞬间我让你觉得
If I was ever stupid enough to imply, for one second,

469
00:16:57,478 --> 00:16:59,298
你对我来说还不够像个坏男生
that you were not bad boy enough for me,

470
00:16:59,308 --> 00:17:02,168
现在我绝对没有那样认为
I couldn't possibly think that right now.

471
00:17:02,168 --> 00:17:04,087
因为我袭击了一名十六岁的男孩吗
Because I attacked a 16-year-old?

472
00:17:04,087 --> 00:17:06,257
你当时都不知道衣橱里的人是谁
You didn't know who was in that closet.

473
00:17:07,097 --> 00:17:08,147
那是真的
That's true.

474
00:17:08,617 --> 00:17:09,657
看啊 他起来了
Look, he's up.

475
00:17:09,667 --> 00:17:11,187
好吧 我们俩让你们单独待会儿吧
Okay, we're gonna leave the two of you alone.

476
00:17:11,187 --> 00:17:12,637
等等 不用
Oh, wait, wait, wait, no, no, no.

477
00:17:12,637 --> 00:17:15,397
你们不会把这事告诉别人的 对吗
Yeah, we're not gonna tell anyone about this, right?

478
00:17:15,397 --> 00:17:18,716
禁忌之恋 让我更兴奋了
Forbidden love. It's -- it's hotter that way.

479
00:17:19,006 --> 00:17:21,326
我还有个魔杖呢
Also, I -- I had a-a-a wand.

480
00:17:23,736 --> 00:17:25,746
我真恨我自己
I hate myself so much.

481
00:17:26,136 --> 00:17:26,796
味道不错
It's good.

482
00:17:26,796 --> 00:17:29,546
当然不错了 我相信 好吧
Of course it's good. It's -- I'm sure -- o...kay.

483
00:17:30,086 --> 00:17:31,925
天哪 太美味了
Oh, my gosh. It's glorious.

484
00:17:31,925 --> 00:17:33,305
比我的好吃太多了
So much better than mine.

485
00:17:33,305 --> 00:17:34,795
-你的酱汁 -就是垃圾
- Well, your sauce is -- - Is garbage!

486
00:17:34,795 --> 00:17:35,605
主要就是番茄酱
It's mostly ketchup.

487
00:17:35,605 --> 00:17:37,735
歌洛莉亚 这就是我们该放到
Gloria, this is what we need to be selling

488
00:17:37,735 --> 00:17:39,145
农贸市场里卖的东西
at the farmers' market.

489
00:17:39,145 --> 00:17:40,425
我们能让来买的人把队伍
We would have them lined up clear down

490
00:17:40,425 --> 00:17:42,565
排得比那个卖纯天然海狸奶的还长
past the cruelty-free beaver-milk stand.

491
00:17:42,565 --> 00:17:44,144
我会击垮安德鲁的
I would crush Andrew.

492
00:17:44,144 --> 00:17:46,694
我不能再回农贸市场去了
I cannot go back to the farmers' market.

493
00:17:46,694 --> 00:17:48,694
那是2011年
The year was 2011.

494
00:17:48,694 --> 00:17:49,974
我刚从哥伦比亚回来
I had just come back from Colombia

495
00:17:49,974 --> 00:17:53,634
带着满满一箱家里自制的顺发剂
with a box full of our family's homemade hair relaxer,

496
00:17:53,634 --> 00:17:55,524
哥伦比亚柔顺王
the Colombian comb-out.

497
00:17:55,584 --> 00:17:59,653
周五 我卖了五十瓶 可周六...
Friday, I sold 50 bottles, but Saturday...

498
00:18:00,523 --> 00:18:03,323
瓶子上写着在头发上停留三分钟
It says on the bottle to leave it in for three minutes!

499
00:18:03,323 --> 00:18:06,623
不 上面写得是"停留三个数
No, it says, "Leave in for three.

500
00:18:06,623 --> 00:18:08,453
一会儿你的头发就会出奇得柔顺"[断句歧义]
Minutes later, you will look fantastic."

501
00:18:08,453 --> 00:18:10,303
一 二 三 就梳开了
One, two, three, comb it out.

502
00:18:10,323 --> 00:18:12,592
我知道问题出在哪里了
Ay, I see how it can be confusing.

503
00:18:13,172 --> 00:18:16,352
如果是真的 如很多人推论的那样
If it's true, as many people theorize,

504
00:18:16,392 --> 00:18:19,332
巨石阵实际上是古代祭司的衣橱
that stonehenge was, in fact, a druid closet --

505
00:18:19,332 --> 00:18:20,212
米奇尔
Mitchell.

506
00:18:20,872 --> 00:18:22,762
是的 很好 我们拍好了
Oh, yeah. Oh, good. We -- we got it!

507
00:18:22,772 --> 00:18:23,672
你怎么了
What's with you?

508
00:18:23,672 --> 00:18:24,741
真抱歉
I'm sorry.

509
00:18:24,741 --> 00:18:27,181
抱歉 工作上的事让我很心烦
I'm sorry. I got this whole work thing stressing me out.

510
00:18:27,181 --> 00:18:28,501
今天你走运了
It's your lucky day.

511
00:18:28,711 --> 00:18:30,431
有个工业巨头来做你的听众
You have an audience with a titan of industry

512
00:18:30,431 --> 00:18:33,571
而且你不用到高档的餐厅请我吃饭
without having to buy the $15-a-plate dinner ticket.

513
00:18:33,571 --> 00:18:34,461
怎么回事
What's the issue?

514
00:18:34,461 --> 00:18:36,201
我接到一个很大的事务所
Well, I got this job offer

515
00:18:36,201 --> 00:18:38,310
给我的工作机会 但...
at this really big firm, but, um...

516
00:18:39,120 --> 00:18:41,520
我其实 一直在考虑
I've actually, uh, been thinking about

517
00:18:41,520 --> 00:18:43,410
也许该开一间自己的事务所
maybe starting my own practice.

518
00:18:43,410 --> 00:18:45,480
-你的直觉是什么 -我不知道
- What's your gut tell you? - I don't know.

519
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:48,270
我很想有自己的事务所 但那真的很可怕
I-I would like to have my own firm, but that's really scary.

520
00:18:48,270 --> 00:18:50,990
而这个工作机会又很吸引人
But this other offer is very attractive,

521
00:18:50,990 --> 00:18:53,059
但我必须给一个我讨厌的人工作
but I'd have to report to this guy who I hate,

522
00:18:53,059 --> 00:18:54,959
也许就是稳定工作的代价
which, you know, might be worth it for the job security --

523
00:18:54,959 --> 00:18:57,099
-接受那个机会 -真的吗
- Take the offer. - Really?

524
00:18:57,099 --> 00:18:58,499
经营自己的事业需要
It takes a certain type of personality

525
00:18:58,499 --> 00:18:59,789
具备某种个性
to run your own thing.

526
00:18:59,789 --> 00:19:01,269
你得是个斗士才能做到
You have to be a fighter.

527
00:19:01,729 --> 00:19:02,789
真有意思
Well, this is fun.

528
00:19:02,789 --> 00:19:03,839
是你想要我最忠恳的建议
You wanted my honest opinion.

529
00:19:03,839 --> 00:19:05,868
不行 小卡 我说了不行
No, Cam! I said no.

530
00:19:05,878 --> 00:19:09,278
极地冰盖融化了 华盛顿大塞车
The polar ice caps are melting, gridlock in Washington --

531
00:19:09,278 --> 00:19:11,548
美国人需要再过得舒服点 歌洛莉亚
America needs to feel good again, Gloria.

532
00:19:11,548 --> 00:19:13,118
让他们尝尝你的酱汁
Let them taste your sauce.

533
00:19:13,118 --> 00:19:13,908
怎么回事
What's happening now?

534
00:19:13,908 --> 00:19:16,918
他想让我在农贸市场卖我做的酱汁
He wants me to sell my sauce at the farmers' market,

535
00:19:16,918 --> 00:19:18,647
但我不感兴趣
but I am not interested.

536
00:19:18,647 --> 00:19:20,427
-我同意歌洛莉亚 -非常感谢
- I agree with Gloria. - Thank you so much.

537
00:19:20,427 --> 00:19:22,337
是啊 上次卖那个发膏都让你崩溃了
Yeah, you crashed and burned with the hair thing.

538
00:19:22,337 --> 00:19:24,147
你还需要更多那样的羞辱吗
You need more of that humiliation?

539
00:19:24,147 --> 00:19:26,237
我们又不知道会不会再发生那样的事
We don't know that that would happen.

540
00:19:26,247 --> 00:19:28,177
逐渐消失的中产阶级 种族骚乱...
Disappearing middle-class, racial unrest...

541
00:19:28,177 --> 00:19:30,737
现在不是挺好的嘛 歌洛莉亚 享受吧
You got a nice thing going here, Gloria. Enjoy it.

542
00:19:30,737 --> 00:19:32,786
什么 你觉得我做不了吗
What? You don't think that I can do it?

543
00:19:32,786 --> 00:19:33,796
是的 他觉得你干不了
No. No, he doesn't.

544
00:19:33,796 --> 00:19:36,986
他认为这家里只有他一个商业巨头
He thinks that he's the only business titan in this family.

545
00:19:36,986 --> 00:19:40,846
没人可以告诉我什么能做什么不能做
Nobody can tell me what I can or cannot do.

546
00:19:40,846 --> 00:19:42,776
我要去卖酱汁了
I have some sauce to sell.

547
00:19:42,846 --> 00:19:45,725
而我现在要去注册我的新事务所了
And I'm gonna go register my new firm right now.

548
00:19:45,835 --> 00:19:47,775
我也要愤然离去了
And I'm gonna storm out, too,

549
00:19:47,775 --> 00:19:51,005
尽管那二位所做的事都让我很开心
even though both of those things actually make me very happy.

550
00:20:00,684 --> 00:20:02,974
你们想知道是什么在鞭策杰·普里契特吗
You want to know what drove Jay Pritchett?

551
00:20:03,824 --> 00:20:05,954
有人告诉我 我不够优秀
People telling me I wasn't good enough.

552
00:20:06,014 --> 00:20:07,774
如果有人告诉你
There's something about a person telling you

553
00:20:07,774 --> 00:20:08,974
你不能做某些事
you can't do something.

554
00:20:08,974 --> 00:20:10,074
血
Blood.

555
00:20:11,244 --> 00:20:13,133
那恰好点燃了好胜的火苗...
It just lights the competitive fires...

556
00:20:16,283 --> 00:20:18,623
驱使我们去冒险
drives us to take risks...

557
00:20:21,153 --> 00:20:23,513
为我们开启了新的机会
opens us up to new opportunities...

558
00:20:24,523 --> 00:20:25,772
莎拉
Oh, hey, Sarah.

559
00:20:25,772 --> 00:20:26,702
对你猫的事我感到很遗憾
I'm sorry about your cat.

560
00:20:26,702 --> 00:20:28,332
我听说你被捕了
I heard you got arrested.

561
00:20:28,872 --> 00:20:31,532
我所做的一切 都是在证明反对者是错的
Everything I did, I did to prove the naysayers wrong.

562
00:20:31,532 --> 00:20:33,992
那些曾经认为我不够优秀的人...
So, to everyone who didn't think I was good enough --

563
00:20:33,992 --> 00:20:35,592
看哪 爸爸 我自己系了鞋带
Look, Daddy! I tied my shoes!

564
00:20:35,592 --> 00:20:37,582
干得好 乔
Good job, Joe!

565
00:20:40,441 --> 00:20:42,001
脸疼不疼
how do you like me now?

566
00:20:43,291 --> 00:20:45,711
亲爱的 我跟你一样不想参加那个泰坦奖晚宴
Honey, I don't want to go this titans dinner any more than you do,

567
00:20:45,711 --> 00:20:47,161
但我们要迟到了
but we're gonna be late.

568
00:20:47,161 --> 00:20:48,081
菲尔
Phil.

569
00:20:48,571 --> 00:20:51,041
菲尔 菲尔
Phil. Phil!

570
00:20:51,041 --> 00:20:52,090
邓菲
Dunphy.

571
00:20:52,090 --> 00:20:53,060
你在干什么
What is going on?

572
00:20:53,060 --> 00:20:54,470
我想付卢克的拘留费
I'm trying to pay Luke's impound fee,

573
00:20:54,470 --> 00:20:55,660
但这个自动电话系统
but this automated phone system

574
00:20:55,660 --> 00:20:57,400
根本听不懂我在说什么
doesn't understand anything I'm saying.

575
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:59,690
邓-菲
Dun-phy.

576
00:21:00,040 --> 00:21:02,490
"邓菲" 对
"Dun-fee." Yes.

577
00:21:02,490 --> 00:21:03,840
不对
No! No!

578
00:21:03,840 --> 00:21:04,800
不是比尔·邓菲
Not Bill Dunphy.

579
00:21:04,810 --> 00:21:07,259
在我名字这个问题上纠结了二十分钟了
We went over my first name for 20 minutes!

580
00:21:07,269 --> 00:21:08,459
菲尔
Phil!

581
00:21:09,929 --> 00:21:10,859
菲尔
Phil!

582
00:21:12,309 --> 00:21:13,249
菲尔
Phil!

583
00:21:13,979 --> 00:21:15,189
菲尔
Phil!

584
00:21:15,349 --> 00:21:16,189
菲尔
Phil!
